# Allow-list: the image build needs only pom.xml and src/main (see the Dockerfile). Everything else is excluded,
# so a new file (a key, a .env, a dump) is kept out of the build context unless it is added here (AGENTS.md C2).
*

!pom.xml
!src/main/
!src/main/**

# Even inside src/main, never send secrets or local files. Do NOT exclude *.sql: the Flyway migrations are .sql files.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/id_rsa*
**/.npmrc
**/settings.xml
**/.m2/
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.dump
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*~
